 "text": {
  "5": "(COUNTRY MUSIC PLAYING ON RADIO)",
  "7": "(GIRLS GIGGLING)",
  "66": "I am. But I'm also a scientist.",
  "207": "to some woo woo treatise on the paranormal,",
  "234": "I am getting a taste of what Agent Scully must suffer.",
  "272": "I'll give you two minutes, Agent Mulder,",
