  "367": "I'll give the orders, Agent Miller.",
  "397": "I sense some professional animus.",
  "401": "I'll deal with Agent Miller about this later.",
  "407": "While this may seem foolhardy, I am anticipating results,",
  "417": "I've got a cordon of agents near the building",
  "426": "To wipe you and America off the map.",
  "453": "Especially one who's so unworthy of it.",
  "612": "so we can get you home, partner, all right?",
  "623": "Thanks to you, I'll probably be banished to my own basement office,",
